{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10382","headline":"涟上题樊氏水亭 · 高适","name":"涟上题樊氏水亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"涟上非所趣，偶爲世务牵。\n经时驻归棹，日夕对平川。\n莫论行子愁，且得主人贤。\n亭上酒初熟，厨中鱼每鲜。\n自说宦游来，因之居住偏。\n煮盐沧海曲，种稻长淮边。\n四时常晏如，百口无饥年。\n菱芋藩篱下，渔樵耳目前。\n异县少朋从，我行复迍邅。\n向不逢此君，孤舟已言旋。\n明日又分首，风涛还眇然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10382.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10382","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}